                404 body (4,691 B) and the live front page (36,963 B) both
                carry <title>統計局ホームページ</title>. Status still separates
                them, but the title conjunct is vacuous for any entry citing a
                page with that title, so the front page is deliberately absent
                from this register and the run FAILS any entry whose declared
                title equals this one. The equality is re-measured every run
                against :host/known-real-path; if the 404 ever gets a title of
